    "description": "<h2 data-local-id=\"81c687f9ee7d\">Summary</h2><p data-local-id=\"d1a228071916\">As per the feedback from <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rA6wTcVOFdstfhumSpffYWSMQ711nvkVZtUMUVA0YfI/edit?tab=t.0#bookmark=id.6chein5hisv\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rA6wTcVOFdstfhumSpffYWSMQ711nvkVZtUMUVA0YfI/edit?tab=t.0#bookmark=id.6chein5hisv</a> an operator can have Direct billing details as well as billing details driven by Partnerships. In the mockups from Wagertech, this was set up as either or, but as per the feedback, an Operator needs to support both. </p><p data-local-id=\"73d0a1999f66\"></p><p data-local-id=\"8648debb88a5\">For Operators with Partners, the Billing Details will be on the Operator Partner Relationship junction record created as part of <a href=\"https://jumpr.atlassian.net/browse/WAGR-384\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://jumpr.atlassian.net/browse/WAGR-384</a>  </p><p data-local-id=\"6ce83716f01d\"></p><p data-local-id=\"195be59ecadd\">The purpose of this ticket is to adjust the Operator page layout to rename the Billing Details section to Direct Billing Details and keep it visible at all times. </p><p data-local-id=\"039b771392ee\"></p><p data-local-id=\"1e65d9dfb8e1\"><strong>To Do: </strong></p><ol data-local-id=\"625fcda04a32\"><li data-local-id=\"3516d472854e\"><p data-local-id=\"8f902f803372\">Name the section <strong>Direct Billing Details</strong></p></li><li data-local-id=\"2cb2ae97cc1a\"><p data-local-id=\"c3fdd69f8012\">Section is <strong>visible on every Operator record at all times</strong>, whether or not the operator currently has a direct deal. Terms are often agreed before the first direct deal exists, and WagerTech asked for the section to be optional to fill at the start.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"1af219fd75e9\"><p data-local-id=\"2c74cac5ded3\">Add the same qualifier to the <strong>Help Text on each field in the section</strong>, so it travels with the field regardless of which page it appears on.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"ac351f1a0adb\"><p data-local-id=\"ce46f61dc343\">Remove <code>Billing_Relationship__c</code> from the Operator Lightning page and from the Account layouts. This field was originally created to drive the visibility of the section, but since the section will be visible at all times, it can be removed. </p><ol data-local-id=\"1ec7bc3ec187\"><li data-local-id=\"2f6e05bd5417\"><p data-local-id=\"dc3a1b514343\">Before removing, please confirm that there are no automations or roll ups relying on this field. </p></li></ol></li><li data-local-id=\"033d304fe1e7\"><p data-local-id=\"be848c362556\">Update the Description on each billing field so it says the value holds this operator&#039;s direct terms and drops the &quot;Only shown when Billing Relationship = Direct&quot; clause</p></li><li data-local-id=\"f42ab6a116e5\"><p data-local-id=\"97fb80d1c9b8\">Confirm that there are no validation rules requiring any of these fields to be filled out on Operator create/Update. </p></li><li data-local-id=\"d638358ee662\"><p data-local-id=\"146007e4a096\">Append to the <strong>Help Text</strong> of every field in the section, verbatim:</p></li></ol><blockquote data-local-id=\"61f1b2a66f04\"><p data-local-id=\"70b7897f5c05\">Applies only when WagerTech bills this operator directly. Deals running through an affiliate partner are billed on the partner&#039;s terms, held on the Partner record.</p></blockquote>",
